===Etymology===
From ''lau-'' + {{m|et|päev}}. The element ''lau-'' is borrowed from {{etyl|gmq-pro}}, compare {{der|et|non|laugardagr}}, {{cog|is|laugardagur}}, {{cog|fi|lauantai}}. Cognate to {{cog|vot|laukopäivä}} and {{cog|izh|laukopäivä}}.

